# The build context is this repository's root, matching the justfile target and
# the Dockerfile's `WORKDIR /src/apps/client-wallet/`. An earlier version of
# this file excluded `**` and re-included a sibling `zolana/` checkout, which
# left the context empty from the root and broke `cargo fetch`. The Zolana SDK
# is a git dependency that `cargo fetch` resolves, so no sibling is needed.
**/.git
**/.claude
**/.codex
**/.agents
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/operator.json
**/target
**/test-ledger
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
